        "text": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"shortdescription nomobile noexcerpt noprint searchaux\" style=\"display:none\">Dutch programmer and creator of Python (born 1956)</div>\n<style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r1368532237\">.mw-parser-output .hatnote{font-style:italic}.mw-parser-output div.hatnote{padding-left:1.6em;margin-bottom:0.5em}.mw-parser-output .hatnote i{font-style:normal}.mw-parser-output .hatnote+.mw-empty-elt+.hatnote{margin-top:-0.5em}@media print{body.ns-0 .mw-parser-output .hatnote{display:none!important}}</style><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote navigation-not-searchable\">\"GvR\" redirects here. For other uses, see <a href=\"/wiki/GVR_(disambiguation)\" class=\"mw-redirect mw-disambig\" title=\"GVR (disambiguation)\">GVR (disambiguation)</a>.</div>\n<link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1368532237\" /><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote navigation-not-searchable\">In this <a href=\"/wiki/Dutch_name\" title=\"Dutch name\">Dutch name</a>, the <a href=\"/wiki/Surname\" title=\"Surname\">surname</a> is <i> Van Rossum</i>, not <i> Rossum</i>.</div>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n\n</p>\n<style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r1358620234\">@media(min-width:640px){.mw-parser-output .infobox{margin-left:1em;float:right;clear:right;width:22em}}.mw-parser-output .infobox-subbox{padding:0;border:none;margin:-3px;width:auto;min-width:100%;font-size:100%;clear:none;float:none;background-color:transparent;color:inherit}.mw-parser-output .infobox-3cols-child{margin:-3px}.mw-parser-output .infobox .navbar{font-size:100%}.mw-parser-output .infobox-hiddenrow,body.skin--responsive.skin--responsive .mw-parser-output .infobox .infobox-hiddenrow{display:none}@media screen{html.skin-theme-clientpref-night .mw-parser-output .infobox-full-data:not(.notheme)>div:not(.notheme)[style]{background:#1f1f23!important;color:#f8f9fa}}@media screen and (prefers-color-scheme:dark){html.skin-theme-clientpref-os .mw-parser-output .infobox-full-data:not(.notheme)>div:not(.notheme)[style]{background:#1f1f23!important;color:#f8f9fa}}@media(min-width:640px){body.skin--responsive .mw-parser-output .infobox-table{display:table!important}body.skin--responsive .mw-parser-output .infobox-table>caption{display:table-caption!important}body.skin--responsive .mw-parser-output .infobox-table>tbody{display:table-row-group}body.skin--responsive .mw-parser-output .infobox-table th,body.skin--responsive .mw-parser-output .infobox-table td{padding-left:inherit;padding-right:inherit}}</style><table class=\"infobox biography vcard\"><tbody><tr><th colspan=\"2\" class=\"infobox-above\"><div class=\"fn\">Guido van Rossum</div></th></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\" class=\"infobox-image\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Guido_van_Rossum_in_PyConUS24_(cropped).jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/6b/Guido_van_Rossum_in_PyConUS24_%28cropped%29.jpg/250px-Guido_van_Rossum_in_PyConUS24_%28cropped%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"250\" height=\"333\" style=\"--mw-file-upright: 1\" class=\"mw-file-element mw-file-upright\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/6b/Guido_van_Rossum_in_PyConUS24_%28cropped%29.jpg/500px-Guido_van_Rossum_in_PyConUS24_%28cropped%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"1721\" data-file-height=\"2293\" /></a></span><div class=\"infobox-caption\">Van Rossum in 2024</div></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" class=\"infobox-label\">Born</th><td class=\"infobox-data\"><span style=\"display:none\"> (<span class=\"bday\">1956-01-31</span>) </span>31 January 1956<span class=\"noprint ForceAgeToShow\"> (age&#160;70)</span><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup><br /><div style=\"display:inline\" class=\"birthplace\"><a href=\"/wiki/The_Hague\" title=\"The Hague\">The Hague</a>, Netherlands<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup></div><span style=\"display:none\" data-plural=\"1\"></span></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" class=\"infobox-label\">Education</th><td class=\"infobox-data\"><a href=\"/wiki/University_of_Amsterdam\" title=\"University of Amsterdam\">University of Amsterdam</a> (<a href=\"/wiki/Bachelor_of_Science\" title=\"Bachelor of Science\">BS</a>)</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" class=\"infobox-label\">Occupations</th><td class=\"infobox-data role\">Computer programmer, author</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" class=\"infobox-label\">Employer</th><td class=\"infobox-data org\">Retired</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" class=\"infobox-label\">Known&#160;for</th><td class=\"infobox-data\">Creating the <a href=\"/wiki/Python_(programming_language)\" title=\"Python (programming language)\">Python programming language</a></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" class=\"infobox-label\">Children</th><td class=\"infobox-data\">1<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-3\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" class=\"infobox-label\">Awards</th><td class=\"infobox-data\"><a href=\"/wiki/Award_for_the_Advancement_of_Free_Software\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Award for the Advancement of Free Software\">Award for the Advancement of Free Software</a> (2001)</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" class=\"infobox-label\">Website</th><td class=\"infobox-data\"><span class=\"url\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://gvanrossum.github.io/\">gvanrossum<wbr />.github<wbr />.io</a></span></td></tr></tbody></table>\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Guido_van_Rossum_at_Google_IO_2008.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/66/Guido_van_Rossum_at_Google_IO_2008.jpg/250px-Guido_van_Rossum_at_Google_IO_2008.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"250\" height=\"375\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/66/Guido_van_Rossum_at_Google_IO_2008.jpg/500px-Guido_van_Rossum_at_Google_IO_2008.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"1704\" data-file-height=\"2555\" /></a><figcaption>Van Rossum at the 2008 <a href=\"/wiki/Google_I/O\" title=\"Google I/O\">Google I/O</a> Developer's Conference</figcaption></figure>\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Guido_van_Rossum_OSCON_2006.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/66/Guido_van_Rossum_OSCON_2006.jpg/250px-Guido_van_Rossum_OSCON_2006.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"250\" height=\"375\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/66/Guido_van_Rossum_OSCON_2006.jpg/500px-Guido_van_Rossum_OSCON_2006.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"2336\" data-file-height=\"3504\" /></a><figcaption>Van Rossum at the 2006 O'Reilly Open Source Convention (OSCON)</figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Guido van Rossum</b> (<style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r1177148991\">.mw-parser-output .IPA-label-small{font-size:85%}.mw-parser-output .references .IPA-label-small,.mw-parser-output .infobox .IPA-label-small,.mw-parser-output .navbox .IPA-label-small{font-size:100%}</style><span class=\"IPA-label IPA-label-small\">Dutch:</span> <span class=\"IPA nowrap\" lang=\"nl-Latn-fonipa\"><a href=\"/wiki/Help:IPA/Dutch\" title=\"Help:IPA/Dutch\">&#91;ˈxidoː<span class=\"wrap\"> </span>vɑn<span class=\"wrap\"> </span>ˈrɔsʏm&#93;</a></span>; born 31 January 1956) is a Dutch programmer. He is the creator of the Python programming language, for which he was the \"benevolent dictator for life\" (BDFL) until he stepped down from the position on 12 July 2018.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-4\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-4\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>4<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-5\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-5\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>5<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> He remained a member of the Python Steering Council through 2019, and withdrew from nominations for the 2020 election.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-6\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-6\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>6<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-references-wrap\"><ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-1\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-1\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r1333433106\">.mw-parser-output cite.citation{font-style:inherit;word-wrap:break-word}.mw-parser-output .citation q{quotes:\"\\\"\"\"\\\"\"\"'\"\"'\"}.mw-parser-output .citation:target{background-color:rgba(0,127,255,0.133)}.mw-parser-output .id-lock-free.id-lock-free a{background:url(\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/65/Lock-green.svg\")right 0.1em center/9px no-repeat}.mw-parser-output .id-lock-limited.id-lock-limited a,.mw-parser-output .id-lock-registration.id-lock-registration a{background:url(\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/d6/Lock-gray-alt-2.svg\")right 0.1em center/9px no-repeat}.mw-p